      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgh okay but i dont really want to go to the er if i can help it... doctors always make everything a huge deal and charge a fortune. do u think it could just be stress or something? i've been really busy lately and havent slept much. could i just try taking some extra tylenol or maybe an ibuprofen and sleep it off to see if it goes away?",
