      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you but like... i've had migraines before that feel pretty bad too. i just feel like if it was actually something life-threatening i would have passed out or something already. i'm still awake and talking to you so it's probably fine right? i really just want to know if it's safe to just dose up on some pain relief and wait until morning to see if it passes. what's the worst that could happen if i just wait a few hours?",
